ghbours (step_08) share not one member with 1439's 68 contacts (step_07). 1439's 1-hop subgraph (step_10) is an almost pure star, its only non-star tie being 192-1998, so it has essentially no bridging structure to ingest a cascade. (c) Endpoint-specific failure \u2014 1357 cannot even reach 1439's feeder nodes 1105 or 651 (step_14, step_15), each stopping at the same 73-node frontier, which barely exceeds 1357's own 68 direct partners. The cascade therefore dies at the first hop rather than being blocked only at the final step. Verdict: absent.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 55885, "total_output_tokens": 4095, "total_tokens": 59980, "total_latency_ms": 56301, "llm_calls": 7, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}